{
  "about": "The Assistant's questionnaire as data, neutral from language: the steps, their choices and what each choice writes into candidate_profile.yml. Texts: shared/locales/<lang>.json, keys onb.<step>.object, onb.<step>.text, onb.<step>.opt.<id> (and onb.role.other_prompt). Ported from the game's scripted onboarding (game/scripts/setup/scripted_onboarding.gd) without its intro, confidence and finish steps. Only fields of the canonical profile (shared/config/profile-schema.ts) are written; tests/test_onboarding_questionnaire.py keeps this file, the schema and the seven languages in step.",
  "effects": {
    "set": "fields of the profile set to a value (L1 fields of the schema)",
    "add": "values added to a list field of the profile",
    "preference": "an item {heading: onb.<step>.object, text: the chosen label} in the recommended block of key `preferences` (kind key_points)",
    "ask": "fields the chat still has to ask: nothing is written for them"
  },
  "version": 1,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "role",
      "key": "onb.role",
      "note": "target_role (the title the person wants) is mandatory in the profile and is not a choice: it is asked in the chat; for «other» the free text answers it.",
